        "Taking care of your health doesn't have to mean spending more. Renasant Rewards Extra account holders can access health-related savings on prescriptions, vision care and hearing services through their BaZing Health Savings Card.",
        "Identity theft can happen in ways you may not expect, but a few simple habits can help reduce your risk. From protecting your Social Security number to monitoring your accounts and staying alert for suspicious messages, being proactive can help keep your information safer.",
